---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '@lib/constants';
---

<Base
  title="About the experiment"
  description="Who is running this and why."
>
  <section class="container-page py-16 md:py-24 max-w-reading">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">About</p>
    <h1>Who is running this and why.</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 prose-body space-y-5">
      <p>
        The experiment is run by Irina Velez. Fifteen years in LATAM digital
        and AI strategy at Nokia and Claro across eleven countries; now
        based in San Francisco; building toward a thing that can plausibly
        be called <strong class="font-medium text-ink">Ari</strong>, but only
        if 100 founders confirm it.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site exists for the discovery sprint. It runs from May 2 to May 17,
        2026. After that, the experiment closes and whatever the data points to
        gets built under a different surface.
      </p>
      <p>
        The deeper biography, the manifesto, and the longer-running
        body of work all live at <a
          href={SITE.author.site}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="font-medium"
          >{SITE.author.site.replace('https://', '')}</a
        >. This site stays narrow on purpose: the experiment is the experiment.
      </p>
      <p>
        For long-form thinking during and after the sprint, the
        newsletter is <a
          href={SITE.newsletter.url}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="font-medium">{SITE.newsletter.name}</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-md">
      <a
        href={SITE.author.site}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="btn"
      >
        irinavelez.com →
      </a>
      <a
        href={SITE.newsletter.url}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="btn-primary"
      >
        {SITE.newsletter.name} →
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12">
      <a href="/" class="font-mono text-sm tracking-wide hover:text-signal">
        ← Back to the experiment
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
